<%# Utility/legal screen, not a primary app screen — no FAB. %>
<% content_for(:hide_quick_actions) { "true" } %>
<% content_for(:hide_calendar_fab) { "true" } %>

<div class="bg-white min-h-screen max-w-app mx-auto px-8" style="padding-top:calc(60px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));padding-bottom:calc(3rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))">

  <div class="mb-6">
    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="text-brand-primary no-underline text-base font-normal">
      &lt; back
    </a>
  </div>

  <h1 class="text-brand-primary text-28 font-bold uppercase tracking-[2px] mb-8 text-center">
    Terms of Use
  </h1>

  <div class="text-brand-secondary text-15 leading-relaxed">

    <p class="mb-5">
      By using Season, you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-brand-primary text-17 font-semibold mb-2.5">1. Use of the App</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">
      Season is a personal menstrual cycle tracking app. You must be at least 16 years old to use it. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-brand-primary text-17 font-semibold mb-2.5">2. Health disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">
      Season is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice. The information provided is for informational purposes only. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-brand-primary text-17 font-semibold mb-2.5">3. Your data</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">
      You own your data. We process it only to provide the service. See our <a href="<%= privacy_path %>" class="text-brand-primary">Privacy Policy</a> for full details.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-brand-primary text-17 font-semibold mb-2.5">4. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">
      We may update these terms from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes via the app or email.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-brand-primary text-17 font-semibold mb-2.5">5. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">
      Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@season.vision" class="text-brand-primary">info@season.vision</a>
    </p>

  </div>

</div>
